WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:19.708
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:27.126
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:30.313
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.313 --> 00:00:34.541
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:40.202
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.202 --> 00:00:45.685
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.685 --> 00:00:51.420
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:57.652
Records opens on today — the bar at the top says so.

9
00:00:57.652 --> 00:01:04.936
The arrows step back one day at a time.

10
00:01:04.936 --> 00:01:10.650
The date changes, and so does everything under it.

11
00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:18.003
For a day further back, tap the date itself.

12
00:01:18.003 --> 00:01:23.710
A dot marks every day somebody checked in.

13
00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:28.386
Pick a day to jump straight to it.

14
00:01:28.386 --> 00:01:36.900
Or tap Today to come back.
